{"id": "spent-first-approved-later", "title": "Just under $10 million first; the Board's vote came later", "seconds": 130.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.152, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "de5ddf616e2086b8", "words": 411, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Since 1988, the City Charter has required a Board vote on contracts expected to hit 10 million.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.92, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The Charter rule", "sub": "since 1988"}, "emph": ["10 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.54, 1.21, 1.31, 1.51, 1.8, 2.01, 2.41, 2.52, 2.92, 3.21, 3.4, 3.96, 4.44, 4.6, 4.86, 5.08]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2002, the City Attorney warned of a loophole: sign for less, then raise it later.", "t0": 6.04, "t1": 11.26, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "could avoid Board review of very large contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.17, 0.48, 0.94, 1.07, 1.22, 1.59, 1.99, 2.12, 2.2, 3.04, 3.3, 3.48, 4.07, 4.29, 4.65, 4.85]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "The Board’s analyst reported six deals since 2018 that started just under the line.", "t0": 11.38, "t1": 15.92, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Six cases since 2018", "sub": "just under the line, then the Board"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.34, 0.7, 1.27, 1.53, 1.86, 2.06, 2.28, 2.66, 2.99, 3.41, 3.67, 3.92, 4.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "How big did the biggest get?", "t0": 16.04, "t1": 17.55, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Six cases since 2018", "sub": "just under the line, then the Board"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.28, 0.41, 0.49, 0.79]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[4]"], "text": "94.5 million dollars.", "t0": 17.55, "t1": 19.85, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$94.5 million", "label": "Progress Foundation, December 2018"}, "emph": ["94.5"], "wt": [0.04, 0.55, 0.95, 1.23, 1.72]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "Case one.", "t0": 20.47, "t1": 21.16, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.26]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "In 2018, the health department signed Progress Foundation for 9,645,691 dollars.", "t0": 21.28, "t1": 26.67, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.26, 0.75, 0.88, 1.09, 1.44, 1.74, 2.22, 2.78, 2.97, 3.18, 3.42, 3.82, 4.04, 4.6]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "How long?", "t0": 26.79, "t1": 27.25, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[10]"], "text": "Six months.", "t0": 27.25, "t1": 28.37, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "6 months", "label": "though the bid said one year", "sub": "the bidding document said a one-year first term"}, "emph": ["Six"], "wt": [0.04, 0.61]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "The records don’t say why.", "t0": 28.89, "t1": 30.14, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17,973,059", "label": "projected spending that year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.37, 0.53, 0.79]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "But the department expected nearly 18 million of spending that year: 17,973,059.", "t0": 30.26, "t1": 34.6, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17,973,059", "label": "projected spending that year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.13, 0.49, 0.99, 1.38, 1.75, 2.2, 2.28, 2.63, 2.83, 3.32, 3.53, 3.83]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[12]"], "text": "The department did send that six-month deal to the Board, in June 2018.", "t0": 34.72, "t1": 38.49, "shot": "b6b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "File 18-0656", "kicker": "Sent to the Board", "sub": "June 2018 · never heard"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.55, 0.77, 1.03, 1.25, 1.67, 1.91, 1.98, 2.07, 2.49, 2.64, 2.9, 3.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[12]"], "text": "It was never heard, and that December it was filed as inactive.", "t0": 38.61, "t1": 42.16, "shot": "b6b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "File 18-0656", "kicker": "Sent to the Board", "sub": "June 2018 · never heard"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.25, 0.53, 1.13, 1.21, 1.36, 1.85, 2.12, 2.29, 2.71, 2.92]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Case two, 2021. HealthRight 360, seven months, 9,987,371 dollars.", "t0": 42.38, "t1": 47.43, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "HealthRight 360", "kicker": "Case 2", "sub": "January 2021, seven months", "chip": "$9,987,371"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.56, 0.77, 1.6, 2.01, 2.15, 2.4, 3.06, 3.29, 3.83, 4.07, 4.31, 4.61]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[10]"], "text": "It paid out about 17.4 to 18 million a year.", "t0": 47.55, "t1": 51.16, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "about $17.4 million to $18 million a year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.31, 0.45, 0.67, 1.17, 1.5, 1.78, 2.05, 2.42, 2.98, 3.18]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[10]"], "text": "So seven months was the only way to fit under the line.", "t0": 51.28, "t1": 53.65, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "about $17.4 million to $18 million a year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.37, 0.65, 0.79, 0.93, 1.15, 1.35, 1.48, 1.62, 1.81, 1.93]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[3]"], "text": "Then it grew to 46,766,160 with no vote. The Board approved it after the fact.", "t0": 53.77, "t1": 58.75, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$46,766,160", "label": "extended to June 2023, no vote first"}, "emph": ["after the fact"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.4, 0.56, 0.7, 0.98, 1.4, 1.7, 1.81, 2.22, 2.46, 2.65, 3.12, 3.46, 3.67, 3.98, 4.17, 4.42, 4.54]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]"], "text": "The department’s reason in 2021: pandemic workload.", "t0": 58.87, "t1": 62.28, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "pandemic workload"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.55, 0.95, 1.07, 1.28, 1.84, 2.77]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "Case three.", "t0": 62.5, "t1": 63.12, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "The analyst said it outright:", "t0": 63.24, "t1": 64.72, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.54, 0.69, 0.83]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "a contract at 9,989,672 was just below the threshold.", "t0": 64.72, "t1": 67.98, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.14, 0.65, 0.73, 0.96, 1.17, 1.64, 2.0, 2.28, 2.61, 2.77]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[5]"], "text": "Yet its spending was projected past the line. It later rose to 19,622,270.", "t0": 68.1, "t1": 73.04, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the contract", "$9,989,672"], "b": ["projected spending", "$10,026,827"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.25, 0.61, 0.82, 1.32, 1.62, 1.74, 2.32, 2.54, 2.78, 3.08, 3.16, 3.39, 3.88, 4.22, 4.43]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "Case four. A workforce grant was set at 9,999,999.", "t0": 73.26, "t1": 76.43, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "kicker": "Case 4", "sub": "October 2023", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.89, 1.05, 1.47, 1.74, 1.88, 2.01, 2.1, 2.36, 2.53]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "Then the office approved more spending before asking the Board. How much?", "t0": 76.55, "t1": 80.12, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "kicker": "Case 4", "sub": "October 2023", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.22, 0.5, 0.93, 1.21, 1.74, 1.96, 2.3, 2.45, 2.96, 3.23]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[2]"], "text": "1,680,000 dollars.", "t0": 80.12, "t1": 82.69, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,680,000", "label": "authorised above the ceiling"}, "emph": ["1,680,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.6, 0.77, 1.14, 1.33, 1.95]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[2]"], "text": "That matters because the ceiling is the most it can commit without a vote.", "t0": 83.21, "t1": 86.56, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a policy matter"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.82, 0.96, 1.31, 1.44, 1.6, 1.87, 2.0, 2.16, 2.55, 2.83, 2.93]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board approved it after the fact.", "t0": 86.68, "t1": 88.34, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a policy matter"}, "emph": ["after the fact"], "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.3, 0.63, 0.74, 1.06, 1.23]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "Cases five and six: small top-ups, called bridges.", "t0": 88.56, "t1": 91.75, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.23, 0.35, 0.68, 0.92, 1.5, 1.79, 2.38, 2.57]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "600,000 dollars took one grant to 9,940,476.", "t0": 91.87, "t1": 95.89, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.73, 1.09, 1.34, 1.52, 1.93, 2.11, 2.34, 2.62, 2.96, 3.27]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "249,800 took another to 9,999,000.", "t0": 96.01, "t1": 100.08, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.38, 0.87, 1.39, 1.64, 2.18, 2.45, 2.91, 3.13, 3.36, 3.56]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "Is it rare? We counted 85 deals that first passed 10 million.", "t0": 100.3, "t1": 104.1, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Our own count", "kicker": "The bigger lead", "sub": "a floor, not an official figure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.19, 0.88, 1.13, 1.41, 1.92, 2.31, 2.51, 2.74, 3.07, 3.22]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "How many started between 9.5 and 10 million?", "t0": 104.22, "t1": 106.76, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Our own count", "kicker": "The bigger lead", "sub": "a floor, not an official figure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.2, 0.48, 0.75, 0.92, 1.24, 1.4, 1.59, 1.74]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "57.", "t0": 106.76, "t1": 107.4, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "57", "label": "of 85", "sub": "13 within $10,000 of the line"}, "emph": ["57"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Two-thirds, in the last half million. Our count is a floor, not an official figure.", "t0": 107.92, "t1": 111.95, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "two-thirds sit in the last half-million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.74, 0.84, 1.09, 1.26, 1.82, 2.04, 2.26, 2.39, 2.49, 3.01, 3.14, 3.22, 3.58]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[8]"], "text": "No authority has found any amount was picked to avoid a vote, or money misspent.", "t0": 112.17, "t1": 116.02, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any amount was chosen to avoid a vote", "That money was misspent"]}, "wt": [0.13, 0.2, 0.61, 0.76, 1.06, 1.32, 1.65, 1.78, 1.99, 2.08, 2.34, 2.42, 2.84, 2.98, 3.27]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[8]"], "text": "Below the line, there’s no comparable public review.", "t0": 116.14, "t1": 118.5, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any amount was chosen to avoid a vote", "That money was misspent"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.33, 0.64, 0.9, 1.08, 1.57, 1.92]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[1]", "next[3]"], "text": "What would settle it? Who chose those short terms, and dated histories of deals under the line.", "t0": 118.62, "t1": 122.79, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Who chose the six- and seven-month terms"}, {"who": "", "what": "Dated histories of every contract just under the line"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.22, 0.5, 0.76, 1.0, 1.25, 1.42, 1.72, 2.15, 2.26, 2.59, 2.99, 3.09, 3.43, 3.68, 3.79]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "story[5]"], "text": "On November 3, 2026, voters raised the line to 25 million.", "t0": 122.91, "t1": 127.57, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.41, 0.87, 1.08, 2.01, 2.41, 2.66, 2.78, 3.15, 3.38, 4.02]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.69, "t1": 129.63, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.52, 0.66, 0.94, 1.05, 1.14, 1.35, 1.58]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Case 1 · six months", "lead2": "Case 2 · seven months", "lead3": "Case 3 · just below", "lead4": "Case 4 · one dollar under", "lead5": "Cases 5 and 6 · bridges", "lead6": "57 of 85", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}